WEBVTT

00:07:29.079 --> 00:07:34.038
and have less agency and less control
over what was happening.

00:07:34.413 --> 00:07:38.538
That armor no longer serves
us and it is heavy.

00:07:38.788 --> 00:07:42.871
And what it actually does is
prevent us from being seen

00:07:42.871 --> 00:07:47.121
and prevent us from growing into areas
because that armor doesn't grow with us.

00:07:47.163 --> 00:07:49.788
It stays kind of the same size,
I think. And so

00:07:51.871 --> 00:07:56.454
I you know, for me, I kind of
switched armor, you know,

00:07:56.621 --> 00:08:01.621
when I moved from being kind of the loud
party girl to, OK, this is scary,